[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2761.07, "timestamp": "00:46:01", "text": "うん、今"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2764.47, "timestamp": "00:46:04", "text": "通っている語学学校で一番好きな先生は、担任の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2768.27, "timestamp": "00:46:08", "text": "先生です。とても親切で、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2772.15, "timestamp": "00:46:12", "text": "いろいろ助けてくれました。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2773.959, "timestamp": "00:46:13", "author": "@astravt", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MdOwC7qdh0gmlabcCYgLQ5BOZxo7CGLbc14xFv1rO9eQ745gkga99YKsszwMjcyNnEBittX8WA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Joq have u tried 7/11 food?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2774.59, "timestamp": "00:46:14", "text": "そして特に新入生として、彼女は"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2779.595, "timestamp": "00:46:19", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "any 1 stranger ya met there"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2783.91, "timestamp": "00:46:23", "text": "私が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2786.75, "timestamp": "00:46:26", "text": "すべてに追いつけるように本当に尽力してくれました。   だから"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2788.63, "timestamp": "00:46:28", "text": "、彼女は私の一番"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2789.75, "timestamp": "00:46:29", "text": "好きな"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2789.802, "timestamp": "00:46:29", "author": "@astravt", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MdOwC7qdh0gmlabcCYgLQ5BOZxo7CGLbc14xFv1rO9eQ745gkga99YKsszwMjcyNnEBittX8WA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Have u tried mixing drinks there?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2791.79, "timestamp": "00:46:31", "text": "先生になると思うんです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2793.63, "timestamp": "00:46:33", "text": "そこでカクテルを作ってみたことはありますか？ いいえ、していないと"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2797.078, "timestamp": "00:46:37", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",